  "messages": [
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>봆<U+0000><U+0010><U+0002>Ā<U+0000>, querid<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿāoa, cuánto me sorprende\nque<U+0010><U+0001>븀\nnos<U+0010><U+0001>븀\nencontremos<U+0010><U+0001>븀\nprecisamente<U+0010><U+0001>븀\naquí.<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n¿Qué te parecería si nos batiéramos en un\ncombate Pokémon para mostrarte la alegría<U+0010><U+0001>븀\nque me produce dicho encuentro?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0015>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 23,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 0,
      "offsetInSection": 300,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 222
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Te agradezco que te dirijas a mí y que no\nimportunes a mademoiselle Lilette.<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n¿Iniciamos el combate?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0016>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 1,
      "offsetInSection": 744,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 107
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡Un momento! Sois dos, así que yo echaré una\nmano a <U+0010><U+0002>Ā<U+0000>.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000C>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 6,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 2,
      "offsetInSection": 960,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00A10055006E0020006D006F006D0065006E0074006F002100200053006F0069007300200064006F0073002C00200061007300ED002000710075006500200079006F00200065006300680061007200E900200075006E0061000A006D0061006E006F0020006100200010000201000000002E001000020114000C0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 62
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Cuando estés preparad<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿāoa, ¡avísame y empezamos!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000C>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 3,
      "offsetInSection": 1084,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004300750061006E0064006F002000650073007400E9007300200070007200650070006100720061006400100003110000FF0101006F0061002C002000A10061007600ED00730061006D00650020007900200065006D00700065007A0061006D006F00730021001000020114000C0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 56
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡Vamos!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 4,
      "offsetInSection": 1196,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00A100560061006D006F007300210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 8
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Espera un momento",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 5,
      "offsetInSection": 1212,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00450073007000650072006100200075006E0020006D006F006D0065006E0074006F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 18
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Sí, ya sé que es todo un poco improvisado.<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n¡Cuando te hayas mentalizado para el combate,\nhabla con alguna de ellas!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000C>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 6,
      "offsetInSection": 1248,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 123
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡Vamos a demostrar a este par de pijas de qué\npasta estamos hech<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿāoas!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000C>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 7,
      "offsetInSection": 1496,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 78
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+0008>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 8,
      "offsetInSection": 1652,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00080000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>봆<U+0000><U+0010><U+0002>Ā<U+0000>, querid<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿāoa, hazme el favor de\naceptar<U+0010><U+0001>븀\nmi<U+0010><U+0001>븀\ninvitación.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0015>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 15,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 9,
      "offsetInSection": 1664,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 76
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¿Estás list<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿāoa para el combate?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0016>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 10,
      "offsetInSection": 1816,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00BF00450073007400E100730020006C00690073007400100003110000FF0101006F00610020007000610072006100200065006C00200063006F006D0062006100740065003F00100002011400160000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 40
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡Adelante!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 11,
      "offsetInSection": 1896,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00A1004100640065006C0061006E0074006500210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 11
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Espera un momento",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 12,
      "offsetInSection": 1920,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00450073007000650072006100200075006E0020006D006F006D0065006E0074006F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 18
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Oh, là, là! ¡Qué atrevimiento hacerme esperar!\nEspero que aceptes cuanto antes.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0015>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 13,
      "offsetInSection": 1956,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 84
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Me acompaña Delphia, con lo que no te quepa\nduda alguna de que nos alzaremos victoriosas.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0015>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 14,
      "offsetInSection": 2124,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 94
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Hemos decidido que nos enfrentaremos a ti,\nasí que hazte a la idea.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0016>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 15,
      "offsetInSection": 2312,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00480065006D006F007300200064006500630069006400690064006F00200071007500650020006E006F007300200065006E006600720065006E0074006100720065006D006F007300200061002000740069002C000A0061007300ED0020007100750065002000680061007A00740065002000610020006C006100200069006400650061002E00100002011400160000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 72
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡Así me gusta! Me voy a esforzar al máximo\npara complacer a mademoiselle Lilette.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0016>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 16,
      "offsetInSection": 2456,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 86
    },
    {
      "displayText": "En cuanto termines los preparativos para\nel combate, habla con alguna de ellas.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000C>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 17,
      "offsetInSection": 2628,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 84
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+0012>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 18,
      "offsetInSection": 2796,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00120000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡Todos miran y admiran a la estrella que los guía!\n¡Adelante, Clefable!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0015>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 19,
      "offsetInSection": 2808,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 76
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Es hora de sacar a mi as en la manga.\n¡Megaevoluciona y dales su merecido, Dragalge!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0016>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 20,
      "offsetInSection": 2960,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 89
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡Adelante, Starmie! ¡La pista de baile es tuya!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000C>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 21,
      "offsetInSection": 3140,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00A1004100640065006C0061006E00740065002C00200053007400610072006D006900650021002000A1004C00610020007000690073007400610020006400650020006200610069006C0065002000650073002000740075007900610021001000020114000C0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 52
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+0016>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 22,
      "offsetInSection": 3244,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00160000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Hala, ¡hemos ganado, <U+0010><U+0002>Ā<U+0000>!\n¡Nos hemos hecho con la victoria!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000C>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 6,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 23,
      "offsetInSection": 3256,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00480061006C0061002C002000A100680065006D006F0073002000670061006E00610064006F002C002000100002010000000021000A00A1004E006F0073002000680065006D006F007300200068006500630068006F00200063006F006E0020006C006100200076006900630074006F0072006900610021001000020114000C0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 65
    },
    {
      "displayText": "No esperaba menos de <U+0010><U+0002>Ā<U+0000>...<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nEn cambio, la actuación de tu Starmie me ha\ndejado anonadada, Bárbara.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0015>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 8,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 24,
      "offsetInSection": 3388,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 107
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Mademoiselle Lilette...<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0016>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 25,
      "offsetInSection": 3604,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004D006100640065006D006F006900730065006C006C00650020004C0069006C0065007400740065002E002E002E00100002011400160000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 28
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Quienes practican la danza fortalecen el torso\ny controlan mejor sus movimientos, lo que les<U+0010><U+0001>븀\naporta una sólida base para el combate.<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nY el talento de un Entrenador se transmite y\nrefleja en las acciones de sus Pokémon.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0016>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 7,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 26,
      "offsetInSection": 3660,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 228
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¿Puedo sugerir que tome lecciones de danza,\nmademoiselle Lilette?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0016>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 27,
      "offsetInSection": 4116,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00BF0050007500650064006F00200073007500670065007200690072002000710075006500200074006F006D00650020006C0065006300630069006F006E00650073002000640065002000640061006E007A0061002C000A006D006100640065006D006F006900730065006C006C00650020004C0069006C0065007400740065003F00100002011400160000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 70
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Ay... Sabes de sobra que mi sentido del ritmo es\nnulo.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0015>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 28,
      "offsetInSection": 4256,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00410079002E002E002E00200053006100620065007300200064006500200073006F00620072006100200071007500650020006D0069002000730065006E007400690064006F002000640065006C0020007200690074006D006F002000650073000A006E0075006C006F002E00100002011400150000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 59
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡Yo puedo ser su profesora, si así está más\na gusto!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000C>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 29,
      "offsetInSection": 4376,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00A10059006F00200070007500650064006F0020007300650072002000730075002000700072006F006600650073006F00720061002C00200073006900200061007300ED002000650073007400E10020006D00E10073000A006100200067007500730074006F0021001000020114000C0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 57
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Te agradezco la oferta.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0015>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 30,
      "offsetInSection": 4492,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "005400650020006100670072006100640065007A0063006F0020006C00610020006F00660065007200740061002E00100002011400150000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 28
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Acepta tú este humilde presente como símbolo\nde vuestra victoria, <U+0010><U+0002>Ā<U+0000>.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0015>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 6,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 31,
      "offsetInSection": 4548,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 76
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Has recibido el Vestido de Lilette.",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 32,
      "offsetInSection": 4700,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00480061007300200072006500630069006200690064006F00200065006C0020005600650073007400690064006F0020006400650020004C0069006C0065007400740065002E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 36
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>봆<U+0000>¡¿<U+0010><U+0002>Ā<U+0000> y mademoiselle Lilette con\nla misma<U+0010><U+0001>븀\nropa?!<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nEstá claro que en esta dimensión pueden suceder\ncosas de lo más inesperadas.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000C>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 13,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 33,
      "offsetInSection": 4772,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 141
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Si la Lilette de la otra dimensión está preocupada\npor su falta de ritmo, supongo que lo mismo<U+0010><U+0001>븀\nocurrirá en nuestro mundo.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000C>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 34,
      "offsetInSection": 5056,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 129
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Siempre he evitado bailar en público en la medida\nde lo posible.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0015>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 35,
      "offsetInSection": 5316,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "005300690065006D0070007200650020006800650020006500760069007400610064006F0020006200610069006C0061007200200065006E0020007000FA0062006C00690063006F00200065006E0020006C00610020006D00650064006900640061000A006400650020006C006F00200070006F007300690062006C0065002E00100002011400150000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 69
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Disfruto mucho de la danza, así que yo estaría\nencantada de enseñarle a mademoiselle Lilette.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0016>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 36,
      "offsetInSection": 5456,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 98
    }
